<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" ><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/now/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml" /><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" /><updated>2026-09-12T09:54:23+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/now/feed.xml</id><title type="html">Tevin Zhang | Now</title><subtitle>A slice of Tevin&apos;s mind.</subtitle><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><entry xml:lang="zh"><title type="html">2026 03 31</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/zh/now/2026-03-31/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="2026 03 31" /><published>2026-03-31T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-04-01T21:59:26+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/zh/now/2026-03-31</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[我一直沉浸在人工智能领域，因为它的快速发展。模型变得越来越强大，即使是小型模型。代理（agents）在处理复杂多样的工作负载方面越来越出色。我现在可以在一天内从一个想法构建出一个可用的原型，而这以前可能需要我数天、数周甚至数月的时间。还有 OpenClaw 和各种各样的”龙虾”们正在出现。这既令人兴奋，也让人应接不暇。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry xml:lang="en"><title type="html">2026 03 31</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/en/now/2026-03-31/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="2026 03 31" /><published>2026-03-31T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-04-01T21:59:26+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/en/now/2026-03-31</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[I’ve been immersed in AI due to its accelerating development. Models are becoming more capable, even the small ones. Agents are becoming better at complex and diverse workloads. I can build a working prototype from an idea in a day, which might have taken me days, weeks, or even months of work previously. And there’s OpenClaw and all kinds of “claws” appearing. It’s exciting but also overwhelming.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry xml:lang="zh"><title type="html">2025 02 05</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/zh/now/2025-02-05/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="2025 02 05" /><published>2025-02-05T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-01-25T22:50:08+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/zh/now/2025-02-05</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[春节期间本想好好放松一下，没想到 AI 领域以 DeepSeek R1 的出现为首接二连三地发生了不少新鲜事，论文配着万神殿第二季可比春晚好看多了。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry xml:lang="en"><title type="html">2025 02 05</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/en/now/2025-02-05/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="2025 02 05" /><published>2025-02-05T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-01-25T22:50:08+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/en/now/2025-02-05</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[During the Spring Festival, I had planned to relax properly, but unexpectedly the AI field saw a series of fresh developments starting with the emergence of DeepSeek R1. Reading research papers paired with watching Pantheon Season 2 turned out to be far more entertaining than the Spring Festival Gala.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry xml:lang="zh"><title type="html">2024 08 28</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/zh/now/2024-08-28/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="2024 08 28" /><published>2024-08-28T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-01-25T22:50:08+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/zh/now/2024-08-28</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[有一次，一位朋友问我，作为独立开发者，我会给自己多长时间才重新回到朝九晚五的工作。我告诉他，我没有为自己设定时间限制。现在，一年多过去了，我们都同意——再也回不去了。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry xml:lang="en"><title type="html">2024 08 28</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/en/now/2024-08-28/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="2024 08 28" /><published>2024-08-28T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-01-25T22:50:08+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/en/now/2024-08-28</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[A friend once asked how long I’d give myself as an indie maker before going to a 9-to-5 job again, I told him that I didn’t set a time limit for myself. Now, over a year later, we both agree—there’s no going back.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry xml:lang="zh"><title type="html">2023 05 16</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/zh/now/2023-05-16/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="2023 05 16" /><published>2023-05-16T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-01-25T22:50:08+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/zh/now/2023-05-16</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[当我即将加入微软时,我告诉我一些朋友,这将是我为他人工作生涯中的最后一个站点。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry xml:lang="en"><title type="html">2023 05 16</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/en/now/2023-05-16/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="2023 05 16" /><published>2023-05-16T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-01-25T22:50:08+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/en/now/2023-05-16</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[When I was about to join Microsoft, I told some of my friends that this would be my last stop in my career spent working for others.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry xml:lang="zh"><title type="html">2021 04 10</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/zh/now/2021-04-10/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="2021 04 10" /><published>2021-04-10T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-01-25T22:50:08+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/zh/now/2021-04-10</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[我加入微软已经一周了，到目前为止我感觉大体上很满意。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry xml:lang="en"><title type="html">2021 04 10</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/en/now/2021-04-10/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="2021 04 10" /><published>2021-04-10T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-01-25T22:50:08+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/en/now/2021-04-10</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[It’s been a week since I joined Microsoft, I’m mostly happy about it so far.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry></feed>